        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana BBRR213, Solid Brass Round Rope Doorbell Button</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deltana made Round Rope Doorbell Button is made of the finest quality solid brass. Offering both fashion and function, the classic rope design exemplifies traditional beauty.  It has a 2-1/4\" diameter, the perfect size for a finishing touch that your guest will notice when they first arrive. Easy to install with the included mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"229\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-BBRR213-Specifcations.gif?v=1704354750\" width=\"229\" height=\"143\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana BBRR213 Rope Doorbell Button Specifications\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Please Note</b> This is a replacement trim only. It comes packaged with button, rosette, and installation screws. It DOES NOT include the chime.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Deltana BBRR213  Round Rope Doorbell Button\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n\r\n<li>Includes matching finish screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
